            "rationale": "The new renewability rule, which gives the first applicable reason in order, is in Tier 2 as `Loans.renewBlock`. `Loans.renew` and `Loans.renewAll` both use it. `Views.ofLoan` and `renewReason` in Tier 3 only call it and turn the returned error into display text. The patch also removes the old CLI `renew` branch, which called `Loans.renew` directly and saved to the store from Tier 4. The CLI now goes through `UseCases.renew`, which fixes an existing violation. No Tier 3 or Tier 4 code re-derives a rule.",
